{"4083510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nocturnal Watch", "steam_appid": 4083510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the northern border!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit in the Bloodmoon Order, you’ve been given the honourable duty of conducting the night patrol at the northernmost outpost far way from civilized society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locals tell stories of a witch who has ruled these lands for centuries. The Bloodmoon Order’s presence will not go unnoticed — by setting foot in her domain, they have stirred an ancient fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch does not share her forest </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each night, evil will attempt to set its roots in these woods.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s your job to patrol the forest and cleanse any locations tainted by its influence. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083510/extras/12429bee2eb6221b4dcc6ac0cfb092a5.avif?t=1772781573\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“The blood of the moon shall purify thee of evil.”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A location corrupted by the witch’s presence must be purified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083510/extras/208b430eb4d0127b8f117ce82f8024a7.avif?t=1772781573\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They say the forest belongs to her </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your every step, you're not alone in these woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083510/extras/56575db7812cb45c3f9517ba8b559fa2.poster.avi